OL,3,GNorth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA cloudy start in the south of
OL,6,Fthe regions, but turning brighter
OL,7,Fthrough the day with some good sunny
OL,8,Fspells. Feeling pleasant in the
OL,9,Fsunshine and light winds.
OL,10,
OL,11,CTonight:FCloud increasing a little
OL,12,Ftonight with a few showers possible.
OL,13,FSome mist and fog patches also forming
OL,14,Fin any clear spells.
OL,15,
OL,16,CMonday:FSome sunny spells to start on
OL,17,FMonday, but skies turning increasingly
OL,18,Fcloudy in the afternoon with some
OL,19,Foutbreaks of rain moving in.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
